Package: golfastr
Type: Package
Title: Efficiently Access Pro Golf Data
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ray", "Carpenter", email = "raymondcarpenter1@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Fetch professional golf tournament data from ESPN
    <https://www.espn.com/golf/>, including leaderboards and hole-by-hole
    scoring for the PGA Tour, LIV Golf, LPGA, DP World Tour, and Champions
    Tour. Data is returned in tidy 'tibble' format. Completed PGA Tour
    seasons are served from hosted files for fast repeated access. Also
    provides shot-level PGA Tour 'ShotLink' data with tee times and course
    setup, strokes gained for every shot, live and historical win
    probability after every hole, an ESPN to PGA Tour ID crosswalk, and
    logo image URLs. Supports local storage via RDS, 'Apache Arrow' Parquet
    files or a 'SQLite' database.
